{"seq":3,"slug":"yard-safety-dispute-compliance-audit","title":"园区安全、承运商纠纷与合规审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/performance-detention-exception-ops/yard-safety-dispute-compliance-audit","wordCount":3508,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"园区安全-承运商纠纷与合规审计\">园区安全、承运商纠纷与合规审计</h1><p>一辆拖车卸完货，司机误判信号灯含义提前驶离，叉车连人带货从月台边缘栽进下沉区——这类「提前驶离（early departure）」事故至今仍是北美仓库最致命的场景之一。同一周、同一园区，另一辆拖车在闸口排了 40 分钟、又在待泊区等了 1 小时 10 分，承运商按出场时间开出滞留费发票，托运人却主张排队时间不该由自己承担。两件事一属安全、一属商务，却指向同一个对象：<strong>门禁事件记录</strong>。本文要解决的不是「怎么建安全制度」，而是如何把它从「能出账」升级成「能保命、能举证、能过审计」——三件事消耗的是同一份数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>园区安全、承运商纠纷和合规审计是三条看起来无关的业务线，技术底座却是<strong>同一套证据链</strong>。安全复盘问「当时联锁是否成立、灯是什么颜色」；滞留争议问「车辆何时进场、等候多久、等待该归因给谁」；审计问「谁在什么条件下放行了什么、留痕是否完整」。三个问题都只能由一份<strong>不可篡改、时钟统一、状态完整</strong>的事件记录回答。由此得出贯穿全文的原则：<strong>只建一次证据链</strong>——门禁事件采用只追加（append-only）语义，发现错误只追加引用原事件 ID 的「纠正事件」而非原地修改；联锁状态（约束装置、月台门、调平板、信号灯）作为一等字段随事件落库；时间基准统一走 NTP 并监控偏移。事件结构见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../gate-event-wms-tms-integration/gate-checkin-checkout-event-model\">门禁事件建模</a>，本文聚焦它在上层三类场景中的用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"月台作业的四类致命风险与控制层级\">月台作业的四类致命风险与控制层级</h2><p>安全投入的常见误区是把它当成「培训 + 反光背心」，即把资源压在最弱的两层上。职业健康安全通用的**控制层级（Hierarchy of Controls）**从强到弱是：消除 → 替代 → 工程控制 → 行政控制 → PPE。园区安全的杠杆几乎全在工程控制层：让危险状态物理上不可达，而非依赖人在疲劳或赶时间时守规程。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>典型事故链</th>\n<th>对应法规/标准</th>\n<th>首选控制层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提前驶离 / 拖车滑移</td>\n<td>未等放行或未设制动 → 拖车位移 → 叉车坠入月台坑道</td>\n<td>OSHA 29 CFR 1910.178(k)(1)（车轮须制动或楔住）；ANSI/ITSDF B56.1</td>\n<td>工程控制：约束装置与门/调平板联锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人车碰撞</td>\n<td>步行人员与牵引车、叉车共享车道，视线被拖车遮挡</td>\n<td>OSHA 29 CFR 1910.178(n)（行驶规则）；ANSI/ISEA 107 高可视服装</td>\n<td>消除：人车分流动线 + 物理隔离栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装卸能量意外释放</td>\n<td>维修时未锁断牵引车气路/电路，车辆或调平板突然动作</td>\n<td>OSHA 29 CFR 1910.147（危险能量控制 / LOTO）</td>\n<td>工程 + 行政：gladhand 气路锁 + 断电挂牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物体坠落 / 堆垛倒塌</td>\n<td>月台边缘堆放货物、门洞上方储位超高</td>\n<td>OSHA 29 CFR 1910.176（物料搬运与存放）</td>\n<td>工程：边缘护栏、储位限高与货架防撞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>量级足以说明问题：OSHA 长期引用「美国每年约 85 名工人死于叉车相关事故、约 3.5 万人受重伤」（OSHA <em>Powered Industrial Trucks</em> 主题材料口径，应按最新《BLS 职业伤害致死普查》CFOI 逐年复核，<a href=\"https://www.bls.gov/iif/oshcfoi1.htm\">https://www.bls.gov/iif/oshcfoi1.htm</a> ），且很大比例发生在装卸与月台区域。一个常被忽略的合规点：1910.178(l)(4)(iii) 要求雇主<strong>至少每三年</strong>对每名叉车操作员做一次绩效评估并留档——YMS 若有作业许可与操作员绑定记录，恰好可自动产出这项审计证据。欧盟园区另走框架指令 89/391/EEC 的风险评估要求与调平板标准 EN 1398（北美对应 ANSI/DASMA 102、ANSI MH30.1），服务跨区客户时须在采购阶段定下标准对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全联锁接入-yms-把物理装置变成可审计状态\">安全联锁接入 YMS：把物理装置变成可审计状态</h2><p>拖车约束装置（trailer restraint）、月台门、调平板（dock leveler）和信号灯构成一个<strong>联锁（interlock）</strong>：只有约束装置锁止、门已开、调平板到位，信号灯才转绿、叉车才被许可进入作业区。这个联锁<strong>不能只活在安全 PLC 里</strong>——若 YMS 只记「车辆在月台」而联锁状态留在黑盒控制器中，事故复盘就无法回答「当时灯是什么颜色、谁在什么条件下放行」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[拖车停靠月台] --&gt; B[司机设制动&lt;br/&gt;挂 gladhand 气路锁]&#10;  B --&gt; C[拖车约束装置锁止]&#10;  C --&gt; D{门 + 调平板 + 约束&lt;br/&gt;三者联锁成立?}&#10;  D --&gt;|成立| E[信号灯转绿&lt;br/&gt;YMS 发放作业许可]&#10;  D --&gt;|不成立| F[信号灯红&lt;br/&gt;YMS 阻断作业放行]&#10;  E --&gt; G[叉车进出装卸]&#10;  G --&gt; H[作业完成确认]&#10;  H --&gt; I[解锁约束&lt;br/&gt;信号灯转红]&#10;  I --&gt; J[司机获准驶离]&#10;  F --&gt; K[记录 interlock_block 事件&lt;br/&gt;含缺失信号项]\">flowchart TD\n  A[拖车停靠月台] --&gt; B[司机设制动&lt;br/&gt;挂 gladhand 气路锁]\n  B --&gt; C[拖车约束装置锁止]\n  C --&gt; D{门 + 调平板 + 约束&lt;br/&gt;三者联锁成立?}\n  D --&gt;|成立| E[信号灯转绿&lt;br/&gt;YMS 发放作业许可]\n  D --&gt;|不成立| F[信号灯红&lt;br/&gt;YMS 阻断作业放行]\n  E --&gt; G[叉车进出装卸]\n  G --&gt; H[作业完成确认]\n  H --&gt; I[解锁约束&lt;br/&gt;信号灯转红]\n  I --&gt; J[司机获准驶离]\n  F --&gt; K[记录 interlock_block 事件&lt;br/&gt;含缺失信号项]</pre><p>联锁状态必须成为 YMS 的一等字段，每个信号都要有明确的<strong>采集来源</strong>与<strong>缺失后果</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>联锁信号</th>\n<th>采集来源</th>\n<th>缺失时的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>restraint_status</code></td>\n<td>约束装置输出触点 / 压力开关</td>\n<td>无法区分「已锁止」与「仅靠手刹」，提前驶离风险不可判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>door_status</code></td>\n<td>月台门限位开关</td>\n<td>门未开却放行叉车 → 撞门或坠落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>leveler_status</code></td>\n<td>调平板位置传感</td>\n<td>调平板未到位即作业 → 叉车倾覆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>traffic_light</code></td>\n<td>信号灯控制器回读</td>\n<td>无法证明「绿灯时点」，纠纷与复盘中口径断裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bypass_record</code></td>\n<td>YMS 应用层（人工强制）</td>\n<td>强制放行不可追溯，成为舞弊与事故的隐性入口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条工程原则决定联锁是否真正有效：<strong>绿灯必须是物理前置条件而非提示</strong>（「手册规定必须等绿灯」只是行政控制，赶工压力下必然被绕过；只有绿灯成立是叉车进入地感区的前置联锁，控制才落到工程层）；<strong>时钟必须统一</strong>（联锁事件与门禁事件共用 NTP/RFC 5905 时间源，偏移超 1 秒即告警，否则两条时间线对不上）；<strong>任何 bypass 都要留痕</strong>（强制放行不可避免，但必须强制填写操作员 ID、理由与预计时长，超阈值自动升级为安全工单并纳入季度审计）。联锁可用率 </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{interlock} = \\frac{T_{operational}}{T_{total}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> 一旦跌破 99%，园区实际已运行在「联锁常被旁路」的状态，误放行概率显著上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滞期与滞留纠纷-计费规则-自由时间与争议窗口\">滞期与滞留纠纷：计费规则、自由时间与争议窗口</h2><p>园区相关的滞期费用有四类，混淆它们是争议的第一大来源。**海运滞期（demurrage）**指集装箱在码头堆场超期停留；**海运滞箱（detention）**指集装箱离港后超期归还；<strong>底盘滞留（chassis per diem）<strong>指底盘超期占用；而真正与堆场月台直接相关的是</strong>卡车滞留（truck detention）</strong>——拖车与司机在月台或园区等待超时，也是 YMS 数据能直接支撑的一类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费用类型</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>触发主体</th>\n<th>常见自由时间</th>\n<th>计费方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>卡车滞留 Detention</td>\n<td>拖车在月台/园区等待超时</td>\n<td>承运商 → 托运人/收货人</td>\n<td>合同常见 2 小时/次</td>\n<td>承运商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运滞期 Demurrage</td>\n<td>集装箱在码头堆场超期</td>\n<td>船公司 → 货主</td>\n<td>4–7 天（视港口与合约）</td>\n<td>船公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运滞箱 Detention</td>\n<td>集装箱离港后超期归还</td>\n<td>船公司 → 货主</td>\n<td>2–4 天</td>\n<td>船公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底盘滞留 Chassis per diem</td>\n<td>底盘超期占用</td>\n<td>底盘池运营商</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n<td>底盘运营商</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>美国海运方向的规则在 2020 年后被显著收紧。<strong>FMC 释法规则</strong>（Docket No. 19-04，2020 年 5 月 18 日生效）确立「激励原则」：计费应促使各方及时提箱、还箱，且<strong>举证责任在计费方</strong>。<strong>《2022 年海运改革法》（OSRA 2022</strong>，2022 年 6 月 16 日签署）赋予联邦海事委员会（FMC，<a href=\"https://www.fmc.gov\">https://www.fmc.gov</a> ）更大执法权，禁止报复性做法与无理拒载。随后 FMC 的 <strong>D&amp;D 计费规则（46 CFR Part 541</strong>，2024 年 5 月 26 日生效）把程序固化为时限：发票须开给与承运人有合约关系的一方、须在费用发生或终止后 <strong>30 天内</strong>开具，争议方有 <strong>30 天</strong>异议窗口，发票须含集装箱号、免费时间起止、计费起算时间、争议渠道等十余项必备字段。<strong>这直接要求园区能在 24 小时内产出可信时间线</strong>，否则托运人在 30 天窗口里拿不出证据。</p>\n<p>卡车滞留的争议根因几乎永远是<strong>时间口径不一致</strong>：承运商按司机日志或 ELD 的到达时间计费，托运人按 YMS 门禁事件计费，两个时钟差半小时到两小时不等，叠加排队、待泊、月台等待的归因分歧，一张发票能吵三周。解决方式是合同层面**指定唯一时间基准为 YMS 门禁事件（NTP 同步时钟）**并固定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{bill} = \\max\\bigl(0,\\; T_{departure} - T_{arrival} - FreeTime\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{arrival}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{departure}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一律取门禁事件时间戳，不取人工记录。进一步把等待时间<strong>按归因拆分</strong>（闸口排队 / 待泊区等待 / 月台等待 / 园区原因中断），其中园区自身原因（设备故障、系统宕机）导致的等待通常应<strong>豁免计费</strong>；做到这一步，滞留争议率压到 2% 以下是现实目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规审计与职责分离-c-tpat-tapa-osha-记录\">合规审计与职责分离：C-TPAT、TAPA、OSHA 记录</h2><p>证据链要同时满足<strong>可追溯</strong>（只追加语义）、<strong>不可篡改</strong>（哈希链：每条事件把前一条摘要作为输入，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>256</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_n = \\mathrm{SHA\\text{-}256}(H_{n-1} \\parallel \\mathrm{payload}_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SHA</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">256</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">payload</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，任何就地改写都会让后续摘要失配）与<strong>时间可信</strong>（NTP 同步加偏移监控）。三类要素的留存策略不一致，必须分开定义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>举证要素</th>\n<th>YMS 数据源</th>\n<th>建议保留期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>车辆在园时刻</td>\n<td>门禁事件（<code>GATE_IN</code> / <code>GATE_OUT</code>）</td>\n<td>≥ 合同时效，常见 3 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月台作业起止</td>\n<td>月台状态事件（指派 / 开工 / 完工）</td>\n<td>3 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待时长归因</td>\n<td>待泊区进出事件 + 月台指派事件</td>\n<td>3 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全联锁状态</td>\n<td><code>restraint</code> / <code>door</code> / <code>leveler</code> / <code>light</code> 事件流</td>\n<td>2–3 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工放行理由</td>\n<td><code>override</code> 事件（含操作员 ID 与理由）</td>\n<td>3 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频影像</td>\n<td>LPR 与摄像头录像</td>\n<td>30–90 天（受隐私法约束）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>视频最有说服力，也是隐私风险最高的载体：影像在欧盟境内属个人数据，受 GDPR 约束，须满足目的限定与<strong>最短保留</strong>原则（GDPR 第 5(1)(c) 条），德国等成员国还要求员工监控类系统走职工委员会（Betriebsrat）程序。正确做法是<strong>事件与联锁状态长期留存、视频按最短必要保留</strong>，回溯以不可变的文本时间线为主。</p>\n<p>同一份 YMS 数据要同时满足多套审计框架，列在一起可避免重复建设——审计方关心的不是制度文件，而是制度运行时留下的痕迹：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>核心要求</th>\n<th>YMS 对应证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OSHA 29 CFR 1904</td>\n<td>美国有雇员的场所</td>\n<td>记录可记录工伤（300 表）、每年 2/1–4/30 张贴 300A 汇总、按 1904.41 电子申报</td>\n<td>事故关联的门禁/联锁事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-TPAT 最低安全标准（CBP，2019 版，<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov\">https://www.cbp.gov</a> ）</td>\n<td>输美供应链参与方</td>\n<td>实体访问控制、运输工具与设备安全、人员安全</td>\n<td>门禁事件、访客记录、override 审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TAPA FSR 2020（<a href=\"https://www.tapaonline.org\">https://www.tapaonline.org</a> ）</td>\n<td>高价值货物设施</td>\n<td>按三个安全等级规定周界、装卸区、CCTV、报警与流程</td>\n<td>装卸区联锁状态、CCTV 覆盖与保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISO 28000:2022（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org\">https://www.iso.org</a> ）</td>\n<td>供应链安全管理体系</td>\n<td>风险管理的体系化与持续改进</td>\n<td>安全 KPI 与季度审计记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>46 CFR Part 541（FMC）</td>\n<td>海运滞期/滞留计费</td>\n<td>发票时限、必备字段、争议窗口</td>\n<td>由门禁事件生成的时间线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>审计最能挑出问题的领域是<strong>职责分离（Segregation of Duties）</strong>：人工放行与联锁旁路同时是安全风险与舞弊风险——一个能随意放行未预约车辆的人，也能放走货物。因此审计要求执行 override 的人与审批人必须分离、联锁旁路须<strong>双人授权</strong>（two-person rule）、旁路超阈值自动升级为安全工单，并对所有 override 按操作员维度做周期性异常检测（同一人高频放行、放行对象集中在少数承运商都是预警信号）。安全绩效则用可比较的率指标表达，OSHA 体系下最通用的是可记录工伤率 </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>200,000</mn></mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TRIR = \\frac{N_{recordable} \\times 200{,}000}{H_{worked}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ecor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>，其中常数 200,000 代表 100 名全职员工一年的工时基数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>季度审计可固化成一张逐项清单，每条结论都要能追溯到具体事件记录，而非人工台账汇总：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>联锁旁路是否每次双人授权、留痕完整，可用率是否守住 ≥ 99%；</li>\n<li>override 的执行人与审批人是否分离，是否存在未授权放行；</li>\n<li>滞留争议的归因豁免是否正确，争议率是否低于 2%、举证响应是否快于 24 小时；</li>\n<li>视频是否仍在保留期内可回放，回溯是否走文本时间线而非翻录像。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三条线的共同技术前提是<strong>门禁事件必须是一份只追加、带哈希、带联锁状态、带统一时钟的记录</strong>。把事件做成这样，安全复盘能回答「当时联锁是否成立」，滞留争议能拿出 24 小时内的可信时间线，合规审计能在没有纸质台账的情况下完成覆盖率检查；反之，把安全联锁留在黑盒 PLC、把等待时间留在人工记录，三条线会在最需要证据的那一刻同时断证。相关的车辆与车位数据来自 <a href=\"../yard-operations-dock-model/yard-slot-capacity-inventory\">堆场容量与库存模型</a>，事件如何跨系统流转则由 <a href=\"../gate-event-wms-tms-integration/yms-wms-tms-api-event-integration\">YMS–WMS–TMS 事件集成</a> 定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"园区安全、承运商纠纷与合规审计","id":"园区安全-承运商纠纷与合规审计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"月台作业的四类致命风险与控制层级","id":"月台作业的四类致命风险与控制层级"},{"level":2,"text":"安全联锁接入 YMS：把物理装置变成可审计状态","id":"安全联锁接入-yms-把物理装置变成可审计状态"},{"level":2,"text":"滞期与滞留纠纷：计费规则、自由时间与争议窗口","id":"滞期与滞留纠纷-计费规则-自由时间与争议窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"合规审计与职责分离：C-TPAT、TAPA、OSHA 记录","id":"合规审计与职责分离-c-tpat-tapa-osha-记录"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滞期费与滞留费计算规则及承运商结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/performance-detention-exception-ops/detention-demurrage-fee-calculation"},"next":null}